  "intro": [
    "Every Amazon Inspector2 operation the emulator advertises, and what Emuplane does",
    "with it. The service is REST-JSON under the `inspector2` credential scope with",
    "fixed paths (`/enable`, `/findings/*`, `/coverage/*`, `/filters/*`, `/tags/{arn}`),",
    "and has no console action. Findings and coverage exist only while a resource type",
    "is enabled."
